# Normalize line endings in the repository, so a checkout's own core.autocrlf
# cannot decide what gets committed. Without this, a Windows checkout commits
# CRLF and later diffs carry whole files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize them, never diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
